<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets 60 mln warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>UBS sets 60 mln warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch, said it has launched 60 million American style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$45	  PREMIUM	 9.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.97	GEARING	 5.2X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  24.NOV.97    PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$50.0</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
